          "message": {
            "text": "Share issuance uses inherited report-boundary assets while `GroveCompounder` leaves claimable and auction-pending GROVE outside that value. A depositor entering after rewards accrue but before their USDS proceeds are reported receives shares at the stale asset value and later receives a pro rata share of the pre-entry reward profit."
          },
