                  "startLine": 107
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "`GroveCompounder` unconditionally transfers its reward balance to the configured Auction and calls `kick()` whenever rewards exceed the threshold. If that token's auction is already active, the Auction reverts with `too soon`, rolling back the keeper report. Under the relied-on default public-kick configuration, an unprivileged caller can donate one wei of GROVE, pre-kick the auction, and renew the denial after every auction window."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
